Every operation on the target list needs spin_lock_irqsave / spin_unlock_irqrestore
around the critical section. Do not use plain spin_lock.

For rk_target_remove, use memmove to shift entries after the removed index down
by one slot, then decrement count. Validate that idx is in range before touching
the array.

The proc write handler needs to parse the command. Use strncmp to detect "add "
or "remove ", then pass the remainder to the appropriate function. Use kstrtoint
to convert the index string for remove.
